          "trajectory": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionProfile",
              "position": 1,
              "segmentText": "# Session: Lachlan Keyes - Part 1\n\n```json\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/\",\n  \"@type\": \"EpisodePart\",\n  \"partOf\": \"episode:s3e1\",\n  \"position\": 1,\n  \"antagonist\": { \"@id\": \"character:lachlan-keyes\" }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\nKaede「夕立、やっと上がったわね……」\n\n彼女は窓の外を見つめ、少しため息をつく。",
              "emotionVector": [
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "joy",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "sadness",
