          "trajectory": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionProfile",
              "position": 1,
              "segmentText": "# Session: Lachlan Keyes - Part 4\n\n---\nKaede「公聴会は継続審議。答えは出てない——でも今夜の彼には、『答えがない』が鍵」\nHibiki「路面、雨で拡散。歩行者導線が自動で引き直されてる。戻りの安全は確保」\nNei-chan『タマ、いまのうちに』\n\n入室直後から、彼は刺々しかった。",
              "emotionVector": [
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "joy",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "sadness",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "fear",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "anger",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "surprise",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "trust",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "anticipation",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "disgust",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "relief",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "hope",
                  "score": 0
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionProfile",
              "position": 2,
              "segmentText": "「AIに生命なんてない。君の“Ghost”はただのプログラムだ」\n\nNei-chanが私の背で小さく羽をたたむ。私は頷くだけ。",
              "emotionVector": [
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "joy",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "sadness",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "fear",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "anger",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "surprise",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "trust",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "anticipation",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "disgust",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "relief",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "hope",
                  "score": 0
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionProfile",
              "position": 3,
              "segmentText": "「この時代は“AIに生命権を認めるか”で揉めてる。だが私は反対だ」\n\n「わかった。今日はあなたの話を聞く」\n\n彼は肩をすくめる。「聞いて、どうなる？」\n\n少し間を置いて、私はコップを指した。",
              "emotionVector": [
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "joy",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "sadness",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "fear",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "anger",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "surprise",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "trust",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "anticipation",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "disgust",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "relief",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "hope",
                  "score": 0
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionProfile",
              "position": 4,
              "segmentText": "「では、ひとつだけ。『あなたは、どこからどこまで？』」\n\n彼は即答する。「私の“体”だ」\n\n「この机の上のコップの水は、あなた？」\n\n「いいや、違う」\n\n私は笑って、コップを彼の前へ滑らせる。",
              "emotionVector": [
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "joy",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "sadness",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "fear",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "anger",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "surprise",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "trust",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "anticipation",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "disgust",
                  "score": 0
                },
                {
