          "trajectory": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionProfile",
              "position": 1,
              "segmentText": "# Session: Leo Kazan & Millia Stuart - Part 1\n\n```json\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/\",\n  \"@type\": \"EpisodePart\",\n  \"partOf\": \"episode:s3e2\",\n  \"position\": 1,\n  \"antagonist\": [\n    { \"@id\": \"character:leo-kazan\" },\n    { \"@id\": \"character:millia-stuart\" }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\nKaede「今朝は川霧ね……」\n\n彼女の声には、少し心配が混じっている。",
              "emotionVector": [
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "fear",
                  "score": 1
                },
                {
                  "@type": "EmotionScore",
                  "emotion": "joy",
